  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Freedom from  Gender-Based Violence in Morocco</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project builds on previous years of working with local women&#x2019;s groups to specifically address the emerging issue of Technology-Facilitated Gender-Based Violence (TFGBV).  Through community level action research in eight local communities, MRA will fill a gap not yet addressed in previous State or NGO research or programs in Morocco, and meet a critical need to begin developing an evidence base for an effective response.</narrative>
  </description>
